  "act": "Schedule 8 (Form 5000-S8), tax year 2025, accessible e-text",
  "acts": [
    "T4127 Payroll Deductions Formulas, 122nd edition (Jan 1, 2026) and 123rd edition (Jul 1, 2026)",
    "Income Tax Act (R.S.C. 1985, c. 1 (5th Supp.)), s. 122.5",
    "CRA form 5000-S8, tax year 2025"
  ],
  "location": "Part 5, line 75; page 1; page 6",
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "title": "Schedule 8 (2025) e-text: line 75 has no percent sign",
      "summary": "In the accessible e-text of Schedule 8 for 2025, Part 5, line 75 says \"multiply by 83.1933 =\". The PDF of the same form, the read-aloud text of the PDF and line 9 of the e-text all have \"83.1933%\". Read as printed, line 75 would be 100 times too large. It cancels out by line 88, so the final amounts do not change. In the same e-text, page 1 says \"Page 1 of 10\" (the other pages say \"of 11\"), and the opening instruction on page 6 is labelled \"Line 36\", where the PDF has line 37.",
      "impact": "No final amount changes. A reader who works through the e-text by hand or with a screen reader gets different intermediate lines: with an amount of 100.00, line 75 is 8,319.33 in the e-text and 83.19 in the PDF.",
      "correction": "Line 75: \"multiplied by 83.1933% =\", as on line 9. Page 1: \"Page 1 of 11\". Page 6: \"Line 37\"."
    }
  },
